A '''sack''' can be found inside the [[Tombs of Amascut]]'s lobby, beside the [[Bank Camel]]. 

Attempting to search it will result one of several interactions. Most commonly, a chatbox message will say, "You go to search the sack, but the bank camel glares at you menacingly and spits in your direction." If wearing a [[Camulet]], the Bank Camel will say, "Hey, get your hands off my food! Unless you'd like me to start eating the contents of your bank instead!"

==Success chance==
If players succeed in searching the sack, the player will receive either a [[needle]] or [[Grain (Tombs of Amascut)|desert-grown grain]], though players will always fail if their inventory is full.{{CiteTwitter|author=Mod Ash|url=https://twitter.com/JagexAsh/status/1564891627998642177|date=31 August 2022|archiveurl=https://reldo.runescape.wiki/i/99070|archivedate=31 August|quote=The chance of finding something is 0.4% at level 1 Thieving, 3.9% at level 99. If you find something, it's either a needle or it's grain, with equal chances of either. If your inventory's full, you always fail to find something.|notes=|name=|group=}}

